  "body_markdown": "Follow\n\n(323) 433-5990\n\nHome\n\nServices\n\nAll-On-Four\n\nDental Implants\n\nSedation Dentistry\n\nAbout\n\nFAQ\n\nForms\n\nBlog\n\nContact\n\n\n# Testimonials\n\n\n- Based in Los Angeles -\n\nI recently got dental implants and I’ve never felt more confident than ever. I was very hesitant to get them at first since I wasn`t sure about how much they would cost. So I decided to get a consultation, I first went to a different dental office in Westwood but they weren`t very accommodating to my needs. Then with my second try, I found Wilshire Smile Studio. They helped me with everything-they explained the process to me, how many treatments I`m going to need and how much my insurance will cover. Top patient care, I`m one satisfied customer.\n\nAlan C.\n\n\n## How Long Do Dental Implants Last? Tips for Maximizing Their Lifespan\n\n\n- Based in Los Angeles -Dental implants are one of the most durable and effective solutions for...\n\nread more\n\n\n## Are Dental Implants Right for You? Key Factors to Consider\n\n\n- Based in Los Angeles -If you're missing one or more teeth, dental implants are a recommended...\n\n\n## Why You Can’t Wait to Replace Missing Teeth With Dental Implants\n\n\nWhy You Can't Wait to Replace Missing Teeth With Dental Implants According to the American...\n\n\n## Contact Us\n\n\nFull Name *\n\nPhone\n\nMessage\n\nSubmit\n\nWE PROVIDE THIRD PARTY FINANCING\n\n\n#### Services\n\n\nAll-on-Four-Implants\n\n\n#### Useful Links\n\n\n\n#### Contact Us\n\n\n6200 Wilshire Blvd., #1609\n\nLos Angeles, CA 90048\n\nCopyright © 2026. Wilshire Smile Studio. All Rights Reserved. The Dental Implant Center of Los Angeles offers sedation dentistry and dental implant surgery, also serving West Hollywood, Santa Monica, Beverly Hills, and more. | Sitemap | Privacy Policy\n\nSkip to content\n\nOpen toolbar\n\nAccessibility Tools\n\nIncrease Text\n\nDecrease Text\n\nGrayscale\n\nHigh Contrast\n\nNegative Contrast\n\nLight Background\n\nLinks Underl